      "Terjemah_in": "Yang demikian itu karena sesungguhnya mereka telah beriman, kemudian kufur. Maka, hati mereka dikunci sehingga tidak dapat mengerti.",
      "Terjemahan_En": "That is because they believed, and then disbelieved; so their hearts were sealed, and they cannot understand.",
