    {
      "Nomor_ayat": 5193,
      "Ayat_Arabic": "وَاِذَا قِيْلَ لَهُمْ تَعَالَوْا يَسْتَغْفِرْ لَكُمْ رَسُوْلُ اللّٰهِ لَوَّوْا رُءُوْسَهُمْ وَرَاَيْتَهُمْ يَصُدُّوْنَ وَهُمْ مُّسْتَكْبِرُوْنَ",
      "Text_Latin": "wa iza qila lahum ta'alau yastagfir lakum rasulullahi lawwau ru'usahum wa ra'aitahum yasudduna wa hum mustakbirun",
      "Terjemah_in": "Apabila dikatakan kepada mereka, “Marilah (beriman) agar Rasulullah memohonkan ampunan bagimu,” mereka membuang muka dan engkau melihat mereka menolak (ajakan itu) sambil menyombongkan diri.",
      "Terjemahan_En": "And when it is said to them, “Come, the Messenger of God will ask forgiveness for you,” they bend their heads, and you see them turning away arrogantly.",
